    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nREA John Lee are delighted to present this detached 3 bedroom cottage residence roadside lands situated just a short distance from Lisnagry, Castleconnell and the eastern suburbs of Limerick City. The residence extends to approximately 123 sq.m. and occupies a compact parcel of agricultural land extending to c. 8.87 acres, together with a range of traditional outbuildings offering useful storage and further potential. The property is of traditional character and provides an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a home which they can renovate and upgrade to their own specification. While requiring modernisation and upgrading throughout, the residence offers considerable scope to create an attractive family home in a sought-after rural setting. Externally, the property benefits from good quality agricultural lands with ample room surrounding the residence, together with yard areas and outbuildings which add greatly to the overall potential of the holding. The residence enjoys an appealing countryside setting while remaining exceptionally convenient to Lisnagry, Castleconnell, Annacotty, the University of Limerick and Limerick City, making the property particularly attractive to those seeking rural living within easy commuting distance of major employment and educational centres. Attractive opportunity for owner-occupiers, renovators or those seeking a countryside home close to the city. Viewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with REA John Lee.\n\n"
